  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\nTransitive (⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧). Intransitive pair: {溶|と}ける (to melt, to dissolve).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- バター/チョコレート⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{溶|と}かす (to melt butter/chocolate)\n- ⟦{砂糖|さとう}→砂糖：00884_satou⟧/⟦{塩|しお}→塩：00887_shio⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{水|みず}→水：02258_mizu⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{溶|と}かす (to dissolve sugar/salt in water)\n- ⟦{粉|こな}→粉：02766_kona⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{水|みず}→水：02258_mizu⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧{溶|と}かす (to mix powder with water)\n- ⟦{卵|たまご}→卵：02222_tamago⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{溶|と}く→溶く：26556_toku⟧ is different: beating eggs uses ⟦{溶|と}く→溶く：26556_toku⟧, not {溶|と}かす\n\nWRITING:\n{溶|と}かす is the general spelling, for dissolving and for melting by heat. {解|と}かす is used for snow and ice (⟦{雪|ゆき}→雪：00584_yuki⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{解|と}かす), and {融|と}かす sometimes for metal or snow. Thawing frozen food is ⟦{解凍|かいとう}→解凍：19085_kaitou⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧.\n\nWATCH OUT:\nCombing hair is also とかす (⟦{髪|かみ}→髪：02196_kami⟧をとかす, written {梳|と}かす), an unrelated verb.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{溶解|ようかい}→溶解：17585_youkai⟧ (dissolution)\n- ⟦{融解|ゆうかい}→融解：08404_yuukai⟧ (melting)",
